-> demi_reveal

=== demi_reveal ===
You return to the plaza after passing through the gate.
Inside the dog's collar, letters read: "Demi."
You: Demi, that's your name. You stayed by me all along.
Demi wags its tail, nudging its nose into your palm.
-> END

=== confession_intro ===
